340-48H.YAG, 3-ele., 48' boom, heavy-duty elements
7.000 7.150 7.300 7.100 MHz
3 elements, inches
           4.684    2.250    2.000    1.000    0.750    0.500 
  0.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   66.000   66.000   79.375 
300.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   66.000   66.000   50.625 
570.000   12.000  108.000  120.000   66.000   66.000   27.500 

The mounting bracket is a 6" x 24" x 0.5" plate,
represented by the 4.684" equivalent OD pipe, 12"
on each side of boom. These elements are capable of
withstanding 93 mph winds without ice; 69 mph winds
with 1/4-inch ice. 

The front-to-rear ratio is better than 12 dB across
the band (better than 18 dB from 7.0 to 7.2 MHz),
and the SWR is better than 3.5:1 across the band 
(better than 1.5:1 from 7.0 to 7.2 MHz), with 
mid-band free-space gain of 8.1 dBi.
